{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《非份之罪》日前（13日）播出感人一幕，「家姐」帶弟（林秀怡飾）不顧一切，隻身趕往塔東島營救嫲嫲（盧宛茵飾），情節深深觸動了不少觀眾的內心。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">劇情講述嫲嫲在島上不慎扭傷腳，在家中向來被無事、表面性格冷淡的帶弟，竟毫不猶豫地主動背起嫲嫲。在趕往目的地的途中，背上的嫲嫲依然不斷埋怨，但重情重義的帶弟卻罵不還口，默默地背着她前行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">起初，帶弟仍是穿着高跟鞋在山路上艱難行走。其後，為了加快腳步，她索性脫下鞋子赤腳上陣，在堅硬的碼頭路面上咬緊牙關繼續前行。這份隱忍與孝心，讓無數觀眾為之動容。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"89a3a0dc-c041-4355-8a30-eafb586a2e38.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20265OThJOIkCd1784106099.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"89a3a0dc-c041-4355-8a30-eafb586a2e38.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d1d06bfa-e48d-45ea-b248-05bba4de355a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026uZmdnOL3wm1784106104.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d1d06bfa-e48d-45ea-b248-05bba4de355a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">15日，林秀怡在社交平台上大方分享了當日在碼頭拍攝這場戲的幕後花絮短片。從影片中可見，現場有多名工作人員圍繞着她們作準備，以確保林秀怡與盧宛茵在拍攝過程中的平衡與安全。林秀怡亦在帖文中幽默留言寫道：「千萬不能摔倒嫲嫲，否則就麻煩大了。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">這段花絮曝光後，大批網民紛紛讚賞林秀怡毫無演員包袱，親身上陣的表現非常敬業：「太厲害了！隔着螢幕都覺得痛！」「演得超級入戲，這一幕真的看得眼眶泛淚。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T11:19:36.885650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}